(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF ELECTRONICS AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY \(MEITY\)) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: SCHEME FOR PROMOTION OF MANUFACTURING OF ELECTRONIC COMPONENTS AND SEMICONDUCTORS \(SPECS\) \(SPECS\) / PROJECT MANAGEMENT AGENCY \(PMA\) / IFCI) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Provides 25% financial incentive on capital expenditure for the) Tj
T*
(manufacturing of electronic goods that form the supply chain of electronic) Tj
T*
(products.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Investments in new electronic component manufacturing units or) Tj
T*
(   expansion/modernization of existing units.) Tj
T*
(2. Minimum investment threshold ranging from Rs. 5 Crore to Rs. 1,000 Crore) Tj
T*
(   depending on component category.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 25% financial incentive on capital expenditure for plant, machinery,) Tj
T*
(   equipment, associated utilities, and technology transfer.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 25.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 25.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Business Profile & Detailed Project Report) Tj
T*
(2. Audited Balance Sheets) Tj
T*
(3. Machinery Purchase Orders and Proof of Payment) Tj
T*
(4. Chartered Engineer Certification on installation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MeitY Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.meity.gov.in/esdm/specs) Tj
T*
